{"availability":"available","full":"jyothsnaPeruri/mini-bank","name":"mini-bank","description":"Full-stack demo bank: Spring Boot 4, Spring Security (JWT), PostgreSQL, React + TypeScript. Atomic, idempotent transfers with a real ledger.","category":"Design","language":"Java","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-15T05:57:33Z","updated":"2026-10-01T01:59:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jyothsna-mini-bank.vercel.app","topics":["banking","full-stack","java","jwt","portfolio","postgresql","react","spring-boot","spring-security","typescript"],"demo":"https://jyothsna-mini-bank.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.342Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.342Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.342Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:34.342Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full-stack demo banking app: customers open accounts, move money between them and pay other customers, and an admin can freeze accounts. Every balance change goes through a proper ledger, and transfers are safe against double-clicks and concurrent requests.","Live demo: · click Try the demo account to sign in with sample data, no sign-up needed.","This is a portfolio project, not a real bank. No real money is involved."],"features":["Accounts: open up to four Everyday or Savings accounts, each with a unique 10-digit account number.","Transfers between your own accounts, or to another customer by account number, with a review step before sending.","Payee confirmation: typing an account number shows the masked holder name (\"Alex C.\") before you pay, and recent payees are one click away.","Transaction history with filters for money in/out, date range and text search, plus server-side pagination.","Admin console (role-based): bank-wide stats, all customers and their accounts, and freezing/unfreezing an account."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jyothsnaPeruri/mini-bank/b